%% Part 3 modified sequence with data access. Author: Thin Lei Sandi (523K0075).
sequenceDiagram
    title UC3 · Manage Vouchers · Thin Lei Sandi (523K0075)
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Voucher View
    participant HTTP as Voucher HTTP Controller
    participant Service as Voucher Service
    participant Repo as Voucher Repository
    participant DB as SQLite

    Admin->>UI: Open voucher management or select voucher
    UI->>HTTP: GET /api/vouchers or /api/vouchers/id
    HTTP->>Service: Check administrator and load list or details
    Service->>Repo: Resolve current administrator
    Repo->>DB: SELECT user WHERE role is admin
    Repo-->>Service: Administrator or no match
    alt Access denied
        Service-->>HTTP: ACCESS_DENIED
        HTTP-->>UI: 403 without voucher data
    else Administrator authorized
        Service->>Repo: Read vouchers/hubs or selected voucher and history
        Repo->>DB: SELECT vouchers, hubs and applicable voucher_audit records
        Repo-->>Service: Stored records
        Service->>Service: Validate selected ID and calculate current status in Vietnam time
        Service-->>HTTP: List/details or invalid/missing ID error
        HTTP-->>UI: 200 result or 422/404
        Note over UI,Service: Active can edit/archive. Expired can edit. Archived is view-only.
    end

    opt Administrator saves a form or confirms archive
        Admin->>UI: Save create/edit form or confirm Archive modal
        UI->>HTTP: POST create, PUT edit or POST archive
        Note over HTTP,Service: Access and JSON checks precede the write. Invalid requests return without changes.
        HTTP->>Service: save(username, id, input) or archive(username, id, input)
        Service->>Repo: Run voucher transaction
        Repo->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
        Service->>Repo: Re-read administrator and existing voucher when applicable
        Repo->>DB: SELECT current administrator and applicable voucher
        Repo-->>Service: Current records
        Service->>Service: Recheck permission, selected ID and voucher existence
        alt Create or edit
            Service->>Service: Require non-archived record for edit and normalize code
            Service->>Repo: Check duplicate code and configured hub
            Repo->>DB: SELECT conflicting code and applicable hubs
            Repo-->>Service: Uniqueness and eligibility data
            Service->>Service: Validate discount, dates, date order and eligibility fields
            Service->>Service: Reject already expired dates for a new voucher
        else Archive
            Service->>Service: Require Active voucher and explicit confirmation
            Note over Service,Repo: Archive does not revalidate discount fields or code uniqueness
        end
        alt Validation or database operation fails
            Note over Service,DB: Any validation, write, audit or read-back failure rolls back the transaction
            Repo->>DB: ROLLBACK
            Service-->>HTTP: Domain error with field messages or storage error
            HTTP-->>UI: 403, 404, 409, 422 or 500 without partial changes
        else Validation and database operations succeed
            alt Create
                Service->>Repo: create(value)
                Repo->>DB: INSERT voucher and return numeric ID
            else Edit
                Service->>Repo: update(id, value)
                Repo->>DB: UPDATE voucher fields
            else Archive
                Service->>Repo: archive(id, timestamp)
                Repo->>DB: UPDATE archived_at without deleting voucher
            end
            Service->>Repo: audit(id, administratorId, action, timestamp)
            Repo->>DB: INSERT voucher_audit
            Service->>Repo: Read back saved details and audit history
            Repo->>DB: SELECT administrator, voucher and history
            Repo-->>Service: Saved records inside transaction
            Service->>Service: Calculate status and allowed actions from current Vietnam date
            Repo->>DB: COMMIT
            Service-->>HTTP: Saved voucher and history
            HTTP-->>UI: 201 for create or 200 for edit/archive
            UI-->>Admin: Display saved result
        end
    end
    Note over Service,DB: UC1 rechecks current voucher eligibility at quote and submission.
    Note over Repo,DB: Archive preserves earlier order references and saved discount amounts.
